# Simultaneous Frobenius rigidity of the j-configuration

Simultaneous additive–multiplicative cosets are Frobenius graphs
(Lemma simultaneous-coset) and j-rigidity: `j(x,a) = j(y,b)` forces
`y = x^(p^r)`, `b = a^(p^r)` for a unique integer `r`
(blueprint Thm jrigidity). The go/no-go deliverable of milestone M3.

**Status:** skeleton (M0); contents arrive with M3 (checklist C8).

This module is part of the formalization of the Evans–Hrushovski–Gismatullin
reconstruction theorem; the source of truth is `sources/blueprint.tex`.
-/

